@MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress = https://localhost:7171
@token = PASTE_YOUR_JWT_HERE
@noteId = 1
@attachmentId = 1

### ==================== AUTH ====================

### Register
POST {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Username": "testuser",
  "Password": "Test1234!"
}

### Register - duplicate username (expect 409 Conflict)
POST {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Username": "testuser",
  "Password": "Test1234!"
}

### Login
POST {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Username": "testuser",
  "Password": "Test1234!"
}

### Login - wrong password (expect 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Username": "testuser",
  "Password": "WrongPassword!"
}

### Login - nonexistent user (expect 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Username": "nouser",
  "Password": "Test1234!"
}

### Get profile - copy a valid token into @token first
GET {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get profile - no/invalid token (expect 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer invalidtoken

### Update user - copy the token from a Login response above into @token at the top
PUT {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/auth/update
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "Username": "testuser2",
  "OldPassword": "Test1234!",
  "NewPassword": "NewTest1234!"
}

### Update user - wrong old password (expect 401 Unauthorized)
PUT {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/auth/update
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "Username": "testuser2",
  "OldPassword": "WrongPassword!",
  "NewPassword": "NewTest1234!"
}

### Delete user - copy a valid token into @token first
DELETE {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/auth/delete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "Password": "NewTest1234!"
}

### Delete user - wrong password (expect 401 Unauthorized)
DELETE {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/auth/delete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "Password": "WrongPassword!"
}

### ==================== NOTES ====================

### Get all notes
GET {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get single note
GET {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/notes/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get single note - not found (expect 404)
GET {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/notes/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add note
POST {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "Title": "My first note",
  "Content": "# Hello\n\nThis is **markdown** content."
}

### Update note (partial - title only)
PUT {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/notes/{{noteId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "Title": "Updated title"
}

### Update note (partial - content only)
PUT {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/notes/{{noteId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "Content": "Updated content only."
}

### Update note - not found (expect 404)
PUT {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/notes/99999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "Title": "Does not matter"
}

### Delete note (expect 204 No Content)
DELETE {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/notes/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete note - not found (expect 404)
DELETE {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/notes/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get note - rendered as HTML
GET {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/notes/render/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get note - grammar check
GET {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/notes/grammar-check/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== ATTACHMENTS ====================
### NOTE: AddAttachment (file upload) is not covered here - multipart/form-data
### bodies are unreliable in the REST Client extension. Test file uploads with
### Postman instead (POST {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/attachments,
### Body -> form-data, NoteId as Text, File as File).

### Get attachments for a note
GET {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/attachments/note/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get attachments - note not found (expect 404)
GET {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/attachments/note/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Download attachment
GET {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/attachments/{{attachmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Download attachment - not found (expect 404)
GET {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/attachments/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete attachment (expect 204 No Content)
DELETE {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/attachments/{{attachmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete attachment - not found (expect 404)
DELETE {{MarkdownNoteTakingApp_HostAddress}}/api/attachments/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
